<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20251219__20251219_z84krTeVNGDg"><span id="xdx_909_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20251219__20251219_zld9De1z0Vw9"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-19" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000051" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-12-19" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000052" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">x</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>

